    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37978" root="لمح" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ سَمْحٌ لَمْحٌ</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمِيحٌ لَمِيحٌ</span></b> : see art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سمح</span>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَمْحٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَمِيحٌ</span> in these cases seem to be
merely imitative sequents.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَأُرِيَنَّكَ لَمْحًا بَاصِرًا</span>
(tropical:)  <i>I will assuredly show thee a manifest,</i> or <i>an
evident, thing, matter,</i> or <i>affair.</i> (S, A, K.) [See
also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بصر</span>.]

